      "id": "80a57c8c97c7-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "In which of the following years was the Rajya Sabha first constituted? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2368; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2327;&#2336;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which of the following years was the Rajya Sabha first constituted?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2368; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2327;&#2336;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1950 1950",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1950</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1950</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1948 1948",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1948</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1948</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1952 1952",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1952</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1952</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1947 1947",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1947</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1947</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><b>May 13, 1952</b> is remembered with pride and joy as the newly constituted Council of States sat together for the first time. This 'Second Chamber' of the Parliament of India, was later named as the Rajya Sabha, on August 23, 1954.</p><p>Since India's independence in 1947, the government had a vision of creating a democratic infrastructure that would represent people from all walks of life and all ages</p>",
