      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "80a57c8c97c7-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "The term 'Parliament' refers to the ______. &#2346;&#2342; '&#2360;&#2306;&#2360;&#2342;' ______ &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The term 'Parliament' refers to the ______.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2342; '&#2360;&#2306;&#2360;&#2342;' ______ &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Rajya Sabha &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rajya Sabha</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Lok Sabha &#2354;&#2379;&#2325; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Lok Sabha</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2354;&#2379;&#2325; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "State legislature &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">State legislature</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "National legislature &#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">National legislature</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>In the Indian governmental system, the Parliament serves as the <b>national legislature</b>. The Parliament is structured as a bicameral institution, consisting of two houses: the Rajya Sabha (Council of States) and the Lok Sabha (House of the People).</p>",
