      "question": "Which Article of the Constitution of India deals with the conduct of business of the Government of a state? &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2354;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which Article of the Constitution of India deals with the conduct of business of the Government of a state?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2354;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
