    {
      "id": "80a57c8c97c7-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Which article of the Constitution of India lays down that it shall be the duty of the Advocate-General to give advice to the Government of the State upon legal matters? Options: &#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2351;&#2361; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2370;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2350;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2354;&#2366;&#2361; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2343;&#2367;&#2357;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;? &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which article of the Constitution of India lays down that it shall be the duty of the Advocate-General to give advice to the Government of the State upon legal matters?</p><p>Options:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2349;&#2366;&#2352;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; &#2351;&#2361; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2370;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2350;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2354;&#2366;&#2361; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2343;&#2367;&#2357;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>&#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;:</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Article 168 &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 168",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Article 168</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 168</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Article 165 &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 165",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Article 165</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 165</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Article 167 &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 167",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Article 167</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 167</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Article 166 &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 166",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Article 166</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375;&#2342; 166</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; Article 165 of the Indian Constitution states that the Advocate-General of a state advises the government on legal matters.</p><p>&#183; Article 168 deals with state legislatures.</p><p>&#183; Article 167 explains the duties of the Chief Minister to provide information to the Governor.</p><p>&#183; Article 166 discusses the conduct of business of the state government.</p>",
