      "id": "80a57c8c97c7-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "In the state legislative assembly, the Money bill can be introduced with the prior permission of __________. &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2343;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2375;&#2351;&#2325; __________ &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2350;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the state legislative assembly, the Money bill can be introduced with the prior permission of __________.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2343;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2343;&#2375;&#2351;&#2325; __________ &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2350;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Governor &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2346;&#2366;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Governor</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2346;&#2366;&#2354;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Auditor General &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366; &#2346;&#2352;&#2368;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2325;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Auditor General</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366; &#2346;&#2352;&#2368;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2325;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Finance Minister &#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Finance Minister</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "CAG &#2360;&#2368;&#2319;&#2332;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">CAG</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2368;&#2319;&#2332;&#2368;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>According to Article 207 of the Indian Constitution, a Money Bill can only be introduced in the State Legislative Assembly with the prior recommendation of the Governor. This provision ensures executive oversight over financial legislation and maintains checks and balances in the state's financial management system.</p>",
